It seems there is a mistake in the comment. The comment states "Every bit in the valid half-open interval is true after the operation," but the method `clear` actually sets the bits in the specified range to `false`. Therefore, the correct assertion should state that every bit in the valid half-open interval is `false` after the operation.

Here is the corrected assert statement:

<code>assert \forall int i; fromIndex <= i && i < toIndex; !this.get(i);</code>
